From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Joel Selvaraj <foss@joelselvaraj.com>
Date: Sat, 21 Jun 2025 02:57:27 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] power: supply: qcom_smbx: default case handling for
 smb_get_prop_health

Compiler errors without it. Ideally fold this into the main commit.

Signed-off-by: Joel Selvaraj <foss@joelselvaraj.com>
(cherry picked from commit 8f3728bcc1f006d0c7720746a619d9b175a8287b)
---
 drivers/power/supply/qcom_smbx.c | 3 +++
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+)

diff --git a/drivers/power/supply/qcom_smbx.c b/drivers/power/supply/qcom_smbx.c
index 2e095d225f2d..8a139016ae2f 100644
--- a/drivers/power/supply/qcom_smbx.c
+++ b/drivers/power/supply/qcom_smbx.c
@@ -584,6 +584,9 @@ static int smb_get_prop_health(struct smb_chip *chip, int *val)
 		return smb2_get_prop_health(chip, val);
 	case SMB5:
 		return smb5_get_prop_health(chip, val);
+	default:
+		dev_err(chip->dev, "Unsupported SMB chip generation\n");
+		return -EINVAL;
 	}
 }
 
